Local/

# Intentionally NOT blanket-ignored:
# data/, examples/, lessons/, tests/, *.c, *.h, *.csv, *.jsonl
# These may contain legitimate tracked teaching material or synthetic fixtures.
# gitignore is not a privacy review: inspect staged changes before any commit.
